<title>GREECE: Athens bourse okays Metrolife rights issue.</title>
<headline>Athens bourse okays Metrolife rights issue.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens stock exchange approved the planned 2.45 billion drachma rights issue by insurance company Metrolife, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>Metrolife will issue 3,503,718 new shares at 700 drachmas each. The issue will entitle shareholders to one new share for every four outstanding.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
